# Google Ads conversion tracking.
#
# These are PUBLIC client-side identifiers — they appear in the page source of
# every site running Google Ads, exactly like a GA4 measurement ID. They are
# committed deliberately (see the .gitignore exception) because NEXT_PUBLIC_*
# vars are inlined at build time, and a deploy from a machine without them
# would silently ship a site that records no conversions.
#
